/target
.idea/
# Test failure artifacts now go to target/test-artifacts/ (save_failure_artifacts), already ignored.

# Claude Code's own per-project state (settings.local.json, session scratch) is local, but
# `.claude/skills/` is not: those eight skills hold the invariants and the test workflows that
# CLAUDE.md used to carry in full, so they are versioned with the code they describe.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
# Compiled golden-vector generator (tools/blip-golden/build.sh builds into target/)
/tools/blip-golden/gen_golden

# The SPA (W3). `pnpm install && pnpm run build` in `web/` produces `web/dist`, which `rust-embed` bakes
# into the binary at compile time — build output, not source. The directory itself must exist for the
# crate to compile at all, which is what the committed `web/dist/.gitkeep` is for.
/web/node_modules/
/web/dist/*
!/web/dist/.gitkeep

# W7's run directories: `gb serve` keeps a run's save state, transcript and the model's notes in
# `$GB_RUN_DIR/<run-id>/`, defaulting to here. It is a run's state, not the project's.
/runs
